## Title: RPG Dialogue: Blasted Lands |cff8a8a8a1.2.0|r
## Notes: Nethergarde Keep, the Alliance's grim watch over the Dark Portal: a harried quartermaster, a mage who reads Khadgar, a Wildhammer diviner and an elf who wants peace with the Horde; and out in the red wastes a broken draenei collector, two elven bloodmages and an old warlock at a demon altar.
